    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1368">

                <pb facs="1625" n="1427" xml:id="pg1427"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of the Army Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1368<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Under Secretary of the Navy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gates</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Assistant Chief of
                        Staff for Plans to the Commander in Chief, United States Fleet</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gardner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-21">21 July 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>ComNavEu passes action UnderSecNavs 212100 to CominCh and CNO
                    for Rear Admiral Matthias B.
                    Gardner.</p>
                <p>Please see Joint Chiefs memorandum to State War
                    Navy Coordinating Committee 17 July 1945<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1368-f1"/>
                    original of which was delivered to Colonel Harrison
                        Gerhardt at <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Terminal</hi> on 17 July 1945. It is
                    strongly felt by Secretary<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1368-f2"/> and me that at
                    present meeting no attempt should be made to deal with Dardanelles
                        question.…<anchor n="3" xml:id="d1368-f3"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1368-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1368-f1-content">
