            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1368-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1368-f2-content">
                <p>i. e., Secretary of the Navy James
                        Forrestal.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1368-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1368-f3-content">
                <p>For the last sentence of this message, see <ref target="#d753">document No.
